  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 20 Marrickville Town Centre North.pdf\n\nClause 9.20.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.20.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect the identified Heritage Items  within the prec inct.\n\nClause 9.20.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain distinctly single storey streetscapes that exist within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.20.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect groups or runs of buildings which retain their original built form including roof forms, o riginal detailing and finishes.\n\nClause 9.20.2 - other (development_control): To protect  significant streetscape s and/or public domain elements within the precinct including landscaping, fencing, open space, sandstone kerbing and guttering, views and vistas and prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.20.2 - zoning (land_use_zoning): To preserve the predominantly low density residential character of the pre cinct.\n\nClause 9.20.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure that the provision and location of off -street car parking does not adversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\n",
